 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Divergent Fist — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>Once you reach 6th level, you have gained better manipulation over your divergent fist attack. You can now use <em>Divergent Flow</em> on two separate attacks on your turn. When a creature is damaged by your <em>Divergent Flow</em>, they must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failure they become disoriented. Their next attack is made at disadvantage or creatures have advantage on the next saving throw forced by that creature.</p>",
